%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Labyrinth1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333916
    - rid: 268099523943333917
    - rid: 268099523943333918
    - rid: 268099523943333919
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You've been to Labyrinthian before, Mr. Aren?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333920
    - rid: 268099523943333921
    - rid: 268099523943333922
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, and it was one of my greatest regrets.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333923
    - rid: 268099523943333924
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: How so?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333925
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Once, a group of mages and I delved into the depths to find the power
      buried within.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333926
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: I was the only survivor.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333928
    - rid: 268099523943333929
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333930
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: You're sure that it is safe for us to be here with you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333927
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Like I said, my power has grown immensely since I was last here.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Besides, the two of you managed to make it through Saarthal fine.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333931
    - rid: 268099523943333932
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Even though this journey will probably be more challenging than that,
      I <i>am</i> stronger than Tolfdir.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Six ghostly figures appear before the entrance to Labyrinthian.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333933
    - rid: 268099523943333934
    - rid: 268099523943333935
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Come on, we're finally here! Let's not waste any more time!</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333936
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Are we truly sure this is a good idea?</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>We'll be back at the College before anyone knows we're gone.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>You would care about that, since you're the Arch-Mage's favorite!</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Don't forget, this whole idea was Atmah's to begin with!</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Let's just get inside, see what's in there.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The ghosts walk into the sealed entrance door, vanishing back into thin
      air.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333937
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Who were they?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333939
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: And why did one of them sound like you, Mr. Aren...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333938
    - rid: 268099523943333940
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333995
    - rid: 268099523943333996
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: They seemed to be reflections of my friends; of my first trip down there.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Savos attaches the torc to the door, opening it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: After entering the structure, the ghosts appear again.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333997
    - rid: 268099523943333998
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>I can't believe we're doing this.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Can you imagine the looks on their faces when we come back?</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943333999
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>You keep talking like you're sure we'll find something useful
      in here.</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943334000
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Given the history of this place, it's more than likely there's
      still some amount of power here.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Enchanted weapons, tomes of ancient knowledge, Shalidor's
      secrets themselves- who knows what we could find!</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>And what if... What if there are things guarding this place?</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Against six College-trained mages? I think we'll be fine.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The ghostly reflections disappear once more.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943334001
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943334002
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: There were things guarding this place.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: We weren't fine.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The three of them enter a wide open room, with a strange patch of dirt
      in the center.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943334003
    - rid: 268099523943334004
    - rid: 268099523943334005
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Savos seems to remember something about this room from his first visit...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Quick, raise your hands, there's going to be a-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943334006
    - rid: 268099523943334007
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: A skeletal dragon emerges from the dirt patch!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943334008
    - rid: 268099523943334009
    - rid: 268099523943334010
    - rid: 268099523943334011
    - rid: 268099523943334012
    - rid: 268099523943334014
    - rid: 268099523943334015
    - rid: 268099523943334016
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099523943334013
    - rid: 268099551663226965
    - rid: 268099551663226966
    - rid: 268099551663226967
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: During the fight, other skeletons arose from the grave to try and defeat
      the party.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226954
    - rid: 268099551663226955
    - rid: 268099551663226956
    - rid: 268099551663226959
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Savos was able to make quick work of them using a chain-lightning spell.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Are the two of you alright?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm alright...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226957
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll be fine.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226958
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Honestly, I'm impressed.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226960
    - rid: 268099551663226961
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Despite just being apprentices, the two of you were able to handle yourselves
      fairly well.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: This wasn't exactly our first time fighting a dragon, Mr. Aren.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226962
    - rid: 268099551663226963
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Is that right?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: And how did that fight go?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, we won, of course!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226969
    - rid: 268099551663226970
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uh Sayori, we didn't really do much, {mc} and Monika did most of the-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226971
    - rid: 268099551663226972
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Shush, Yuri! He doesn't need to know that.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226973
    - rid: 268099551663226974
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: That's... impressive.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226975
    - rid: 268099551663226976
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess I'm lucky the two of you are with me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226977
    - rid: 268099551663226978
    - rid: 268099551663226979
    - rid: 268099551663226980
    - rid: 268099551663226982
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}? Why''d we stop?'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you see something?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I think Sayori used one of <i>my</i> accomplishments to mislead someone-
      just now!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226983
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wha-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: How would you-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Why does that even matter?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663227002
    - rid: 268099551663227003
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Just past the skeletal dragon arena room, the ghosts reappear once more,
      missing a member...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226985
    - rid: 268099551663226986
    - rid: 268099551663226988
    - rid: 268099551663226989
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>We... we have to go back. We can't leave Girduin...</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>We barely made it out alive, and you want to go back in?!?</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>It's too late. There isn't enough of him left to go back
      in after.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Gods, what have we done...?</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>We can't go back. Might as well go forward. We can still
      do this.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Savos is right. We can make it if we just stay alert.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The ghosts return once more from whence they came.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226990
    - rid: 268099551663226991
    - rid: 268099551663226992
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Sunk-cost fallacy is quite the self-destructive attribute, isn't it...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: The ice spirit reformed the ice wall?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226993
    - rid: 268099551663226994
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: I could've sworn we destroyed it, completely and utterly...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: No matter.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Savos melts the ice wall blocking the door using a concentrated burst
      of flames.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099551663226996
    - rid: 268099551663226997
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As the ice wall melts, the ice spirit itself attempts to slay the foolish
      mage who would dare warm it up.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The ice spirit doesn't really last that long, however. Savos' flame was
      far too hot for it to handle.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Wonderful. Let us continue.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099556554833972
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Just as the three make their way through the newly opened doorway-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099556554833992
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d64100fc3c084684aa842f277fcb2790, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>wo m9z w4 d3 vul jun1r</font>?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099556554833973
    - rid: 268099556554833974
    - rid: 268099556554833986
    - rid: 268099556554833987
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: What was that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: That was Morokei, the dragon priest who was rightfully buried in these
      depths.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: His was the vile power that we foolishly uncovered.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Are we going to fight him?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099556554833988
    - rid: 268099556554833990
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: If we want to get our hands on the Staff of Magnus?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099556554833989
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: (And finally avenge Girduin, Elvali, Takes-in-Light, Hafnar, and Atmah...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Then, yes.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099556554833993
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The group of ghosts appear once more, with one fewer member than last
      time.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551286
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Just a minute, please.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Come on, we can't stop now. We have to keep moving!</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Where's Elvali? She was right behind me...</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Dead. Something grabbed her from behind. Gone before I could
      do anything.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>This is insanity! We never should have come here...</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>You're right. This is all my fault... Shoud we turn around,
      head back?</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>I don't think going back is a good idea.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Going back would be the end of all of us. We keep pushing
      forward, and we'll make it. We will!</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01a9f9af2cb54445b0c607b34bca89e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Come on, you can make it. Let's go.</SineText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551287
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Mr. Aren? Are you okay?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551289
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... it wasn't easy being the only one who made it out.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551290
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Especially because Hafnar and Atmah had to-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: I can still remember the looks on their faces as I-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Did what I had to.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551291
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: So, while it's been hard to see my old friends' faces again...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551292
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: I have the chance to bring them the closure they've been waiting for.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: The closure that they deserve...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099571011551293
    - rid: 268099571011551294
